    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.99999995 against a reference of 1, RMSE = 0.000125 against 0. The SEM foreground, aspect ratio, coherency, and orientation KS differ from their references. The cuticle peak is 20.17 µm against the model wavelength 2.736 µm. The saturated dominant wavelength is 3.72 µm and is not yet given its own coarsening ratio. Outline circularity is 0.018 because the perimeter follows the antennule and carapace folds." ;
